From: Craig Johnson <1545411+captainpacket@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] linux hosts: a plain `lldp` attribute (node, link,
 interface), LLDP off by default under KNE

SKYFORGE-SPECIFIC: platform behaviour; not for upstream.

